This repository holds two kinds of original work, under two licences, plus third-party data under its own terms.

1. Code (the program files in sim/, viewer/, game/, bin/ and the code in docs/): MIT License, below. Data files
   (sim/data/, viewer/basemap/, viewer/residents/data/, game/data/, docs/maps/data/) are not covered by the MIT
   License: see the table in README.md, "Data files".
2. Notes and writing (kb/, research/, the *.md files, the exported knowledge base in docs/kb/, results and
   screenshots): Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0),
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
   Credit: "Brent Jacobs, Victor Harbor roads (https://github.com/br3nt/victor-harbor-roads)".

Third-party data keeps its own licence and is not covered by either: OpenStreetMap data and the databases derived
from it (ODbL 1.0), G-NAF addresses (Open G-NAF End User Licence Agreement), ABS, DIT and PlanSA data (CC BY 4.0),
terrain tiles (see viewer/basemap/SOURCES.md), traffic counts taken from council and consultant reports (credited
to their source), and MapLibre GL JS (BSD 3-Clause, viewer/vendor/MAPLIBRE-LICENSE.txt). See README.md,
"Licences and attributions".

